      "widgets_values": [
        "START HERE: install the packs RedNode Studio can use\n\nThis workflow renders nothing. It holds one node from each pack the Workspace can lean on, so\nComfyUI Manager finds them all at once instead of one at a time.\n\n1. Manager says some nodes are missing when this opens. Let it install them.\n2. Restart ComfyUI.\n3. Open RedNode Studio from the template browser and work from there. This file has done its job.\n\nNone of these are required. The Workspace renders without every one of them and says on the Run\ntab when a pass wanted one that is not here. Install what you want and skip the rest: the\nOverview tab's Check installs button says which ones your own settings actually call for."
