      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "WHAT EACH ONE IS FOR\n\nEach node above is a marker for Manager and nothing else. Nothing is wired, and nothing renders.\n\n\nSeedVR2 upscale\n    A Detailer pass set to SeedVR2 upscale.\n    https://github.com/numz/ComfyUI-SeedVR2_VideoUpscaler\n\nTiled upscale\n    A Detailer pass set to the tiled upscale.\n    https://github.com/ssitu/ComfyUI_UltimateSDUpscale\n\nSegmenting\n    Finding what a Detailer pass works on, and the Paint tab's auto mask. It installs without a checkpoint, so put one in models/sam3 too: https://huggingface.co/yolain/sam3-safetensors\n    https://github.com/yolain/ComfyUI-Easy-Sam3\n\nGGUF models\n    Loading a .gguf diffusion model on a rig.\n    https://github.com/city96/ComfyUI-GGUF\n\nINT8 models\n    Loading an INT8 W8A8 diffusion model on a rig.\n    https://github.com/BobJohnson24/ComfyUI-INT8-Fast\n\nWD14 tags\n    The WD14 tags caption engine on the Auto prompt page.\n    https://github.com/pythongosssss/ComfyUI-WD14-Tagger\n\nFlorence\n    The Florence caption engine on the Auto prompt page.\n    https://github.com/kijai/ComfyUI-Florence2\n\nJoyCaption\n    The JoyCaption caption engine on the Auto prompt page.\n    https://github.com/1038lab/ComfyUI-JoyCaption\n\nQwenVL\n    The QwenVL caption engine on the Auto prompt page.\n    https://github.com/1038lab/ComfyUI-QwenVL\n\nDepth\n    The depth that Depth of field, Atmospheric haze and Relight read on the Post tab. Its estimators fetch their own weights the first time they run.\n    https://github.com/Fannovel16/comfyui_controlnet_aux\n\nSubject mask\n    The subject mask a Post card's Limit row uses to work on the subject or the background alone.\n    https://github.com/1038lab/ComfyUI-RMBG\n\nSeed node\n    Used by the RedNode Multi-Angle example workflow.\n    https://github.com/rgthree/rgthree-comfy"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
